===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|de|gmh|göu}}, {{m|gmh|gou}}, from {{inh|de|goh|gawi}}, {{m|goh|gouwi}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*gawi}} (compare Low German {{m|nds|Gohe}}, Dutch {{m|nl|gouw}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|gea}}, {{m|fy|goa}}), from earlier {{m|de|*gaawja||riverlands, lakeside land}}, from collective {{m|gem-pro|*ga-}} + {{m|gem-pro|*awjō||land by a waterway}} (compare German {{m|de|Aue}}).

